# Strip Mailgun sending-control headers from outbound relayed mail.
# Forwarded messages that were originally delivered BY Mailgun carry
# X-Mailgun-Sending-Ip; when relayed back out through our Mailgun account,
# Mailgun obeys the header, sees an IP from another account and rejects with
# "421 Rejected: IP x.x.x.x can't be used to send the message".
# Proven A/B 2026-06-11 during the mailu relay incident.
/^X-Mailgun-Sending-Ip:/i IGNORE
